# The toolchain's pins, read by the top-level Makefile. Called by: make gexcc,
# make busybox (and, through them, make test).
#
# musl for the wasm32 sysroot is MUSL_REPO/MUSL_COMMIT and the LP64 one
# MUSL64_REPO/MUSL64_COMMIT; both are still in tools/wine-wasm's pin files,
# which the Makefile includes beside this one. LLVM_COMMIT is in
# tools/gexcc/llvm.pin.

# The LLVM fork libc++ is built from (branch gex). It is not published yet:
# until it is, `make gexcc` needs LLVM_SRC, a checkout of LLVM_COMMIT.
LLVM_REPO :=

